  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Cut the tofu into small cubes and bake for 20 minutes.",
    "Prepare the pomegranate seeds by rinsing them in water.",
    "Slice the pickle into thin strips.",
    "Steam the bao buns for 5 minutes.",
    "Assemble the tofu bao by spreading soy sauce and sesame oil on the bun, then adding the tofu, pomegranate seeds, pickle slices, and scallions.",
    "Drizzle the grated ginger on top of the tofu bao.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy.",
    "Store any leftovers in an airtight container in the refrigerator for up to 3 days."
